{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa and The Rude Customer"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Customer Complaint"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Food for Thought > Dividing the Chicken"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 5}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and provide solutions to problems in a range of social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le05ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Writing a Customer Complaint"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Here are some example sentences to include in a customer complaint letter."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Greeting</span>: <br>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Dear Sir,<br>Dear Madam,<br>Company Name,</span><br/> <br/>Remember to use a comma after the greeting."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\"> Closing</span>:<br><br>  If you know the person's name - <span class=\"italic\">Yours sincerely,</span><br> If you don't know the person's name - <span class=\"italic\">Yours faithfully,</span> <br><br> <span class=\"strong\"> Phrases you can use to describe a situation</span>:<br><br>  <span class=\"italic\"> I am writing to inform of my dissatisfaction with ...<br> I am writing to inquire about ... <br><br>  </span><span class=\"strong\">Phrases you can use to describe a problem</span>:<br><br>  <span class=\"italic\">I had difficulty in ... <br> On March 1st, I ...</span><br><br>   <span class=\"strong\">Phrases you can you to describe a solution</span>:<br><br>  <span class=\"italic\">I enclose a copy of the invoice ... <br> Could I please ask you to ...</span><br><br> <span class=\"strong\"> Phrase to use to finish you letter of complaint</span><br><br>  <span class=\"italic\">I look forward to receiving your response.<br> Please do not hesitate to contact me if you have any more questions.</span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Adverbs of Manner"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use adverbs of manner to describe how something is done.<br/><span class=\"italic\">Example: She walked slowly.<br> &nbsp;How did she walk? Slowly.</span><br><br>Many adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"strong\">-ly</span> to an adjective:<br> <span class=\"italic\">Examples: sad - sadly, curious - curiously</span><br><br>   Some adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"strong\">-ally</span>:<br><span class=\"italic\"> Example: comic - comically</span><br><br>  The adverbs <span class=\"strong\">fast</span>, <span class=\"strong\">hard</span>, <span class=\"strong\">well</span> and <span class=\"strong\">straight</span> are exceptions. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "The waiter hastily ushered us to a table."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I kindly tried to explain that we booked a table elsewhere."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to air "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make something known in public  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am writing to air my complaints."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob08aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use in a letter of complaint."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "promptly "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do something without delay "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We promptly arrived at the restaurant at 8 p.m."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob08aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hastily "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "done or made very quickly "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We were hastily ushered to our table."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob08aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "swiftly"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "done quickly or immediately "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Jane swiftly gathered her things."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob08aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "elsewhere "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in or to another place "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We decided to have dinner elsewhere."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob08aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ambiance "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the mood or feeling of a particular place"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There was no ambiance in the restaurant."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob08aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "indeed "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "without any question"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was disappointed indeed!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob08aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "faithfully "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having or showing true and constant trust "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:<br/> Yours faithfully,<br/> Marianne"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob08aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Interview a family member about a time they received poor customer service."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down the details in note form."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Then, turn your notes into a 80-100 word customer complaint."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use adverbs of manner to describe how this are done."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your customer complaint aloud to the family member when done."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I interview a family member about receiving poor customer service."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write down notes from the interview."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a customer complaint."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read the customer complaint aloud to a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can write about customer service. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can write a customer complaint. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can describe behavior and personality."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Have you properly completed a customer complaint form before? If yes, when? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " When would a person complete one? What is poor customer service?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Writing Spot: I want to speak to your boss, now!"}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [4], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": 