 ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [], "type": "learning_skills"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "A Complaint Letter <br>  <br>Don't forget to include: <br>\n<ul><li> A Greeting\n<li> A Body Paragraph\n<li> Examples"}], "video_src": "engenn6le05ob08re3vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 3, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le05ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Dear Sir/ Madam, <br><br>\nI am writing to air my complaints about the very poor service that I received at your restaurant, Zanzibar, on the 4th of June. Our evening was spoiled! <br>\nI called the restaurant last month to book a table at 8  p.m. I later received a confirmation regarding my booking by email that: <Br><br>\n1) our table will be by the window to enjoy the view of the harbor. <br>\n2) my daughters (6 and 8 years old) would receive free children's meals.<br>\n3) there was a special, perfect for vegetarians."}, {"time": "36000", "image": "engenn6le05ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "When we promptly arrived at the restaurant, he hastily ushered us to a table next to the kitchen and away from a view. When I kindly tried to explain that we booked a table elsewhere, the waiter swiftly became rude and unhelpful.<br/>\nSecondly, the Vegetarian special was not available. This showed a clear lack of communication and poor customer service and lack of interest in meeting customers' needs.<br>\nThirdly, at the end of the night, I hastily went to pay the bill. The member of staff was confused about my booking and charged the children's meals to my credit card as well!"}, {"time": "74000", "image": "engenn6le05ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "We felt the whole ambiance was very unprofessional with no care and attention. It was very disappointing indeed.<br><br>\nI enclose a copy of the bill.<br>\nI look forward to receiving your response.<br><br>Yours faithfully, <br><br>\nMs. Janine King"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 4, "_data": []}]}]}